@startuml
[*] --> Create New Profile
Create New Profile --> Profile Created : Profile Created
Profile Created --> Assign Permissions : Assign Permissions
Assign Permissions --> Permissions Assigned : Permissions Assigned
Permissions Assigned --> View/Edit Permissions : View/Edit Permissions
View/Edit Permissions --> Permissions Viewed/Edited : Permissions Viewed/Edited
Permissions Viewed/Edited --> [*] : Done
Profile Created --> Delete Profile/Permissions : Delete Profile/Permissions
Delete Profile/Permissions --> Profile/Permissions Deleted : Profile/Permissions Deleted
Profile/Permissions Deleted --> [*] : Done
@enduml
